{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_LINIF_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_LINInterface","page":26,"text":"6 Requirements Tracing\nThe following tables reference the requirements specified in [20] and [21], and links to\nthe fulfillment of these. Requirements that are not fulfilled by this document are linked\nto [SWS_LinIf_NA_99999].\nRequirement\nDescription\nSatisfied by\n[SRS_BSW_00101]\nThe Basic Software Module shall be\nable to initialize variables and\nhardware in a separate initialization\nfunction\n[SWS_LinIf_00198] [SWS_LinIf_00350]\n[SRS_BSW_00167]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall provide configuration\nrules and constraints to enable\nplausibility checks\n[SWS_LinIf_00375]\n[SRS_BSW_00170]\nThe AUTOSAR SW Components\nshall provide information about their\ndependency from faults, signal\nqualities, driver demands\n[SWS_LinIf_00373]\n[SRS_BSW_00171]\nOptional functionality of a Basic-SW\ncomponent that is not required in the\nECU shall be configurable at\npre-compile-time\n[SWS_LinIf_00310] [SWS_LinIf_00387]\n[SRS_BSW_00327]\nError values naming convention\n[SWS_LinIf_00376] [SWS_LinIf_00729]\n[SRS_BSW_00328]\nAll AUTOSAR Basic Software\nModules shall avoid the duplication of\ncode\n[SWS_LinIf_00386]\n[SRS_BSW_00335]\nStatus values naming convention\n[SWS_LinIf_00316] [SWS_LinIf_00319]\n[SWS_LinIf_00438] [SWS_LinIf_00439]\n[SWS_LinIf_00441] [SWS_LinIf_00442]\n[SRS_BSW_00336]\nBasic SW module shall be able to\nshutdown\n[SWS_LinIf_00355]\n[SRS_BSW_00337]\nClassification of development errors\n[SWS_LinIf_00376]\n[SRS_BSW_00344]\nBSW Modules shall support link-time\nconfiguration\n[SWS_LinIf_00373]\n[SRS_BSW_00358]\nThe return type of init() functions\nimplemented by AUTOSAR Basic\nSoftware Modules shall be void\n[SWS_LinIf_00198] [SWS_LinIf_00350]\n[SRS_BSW_00373]\nThe main processing function of each\nAUTOSAR Basic Software Module\nshall be named according the defined\nconvention\n[SWS_LinIf_00384]\n[SRS_BSW_00375]\nBasic Software Modules shall report\nwake-up reasons\n[SWS_LinIf_00378]\n[SRS_BSW_00385]\nList possible error notifications\n[SWS_LinIf_00376] [SWS_LinIf_00729]\n[SRS_BSW_00404]\nBSW Modules shall support\npost-b…","caption":"6 Requirements Tracing","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_LINIF_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R23-11"],"page":26,"hash":"c14f911505ef36b2","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/9055a89a9167/page_26.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_LINIF_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R24-11"],"page":26,"hash":"608f3ef19700a304","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/c79c531ec3fa/page_26.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_LINIF_SECTION_6_Requirements_Tracing","releases":["R25-11"],"page":28,"hash":"b294bab4cd4a9690","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/abc58140e344/page_28.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/abc58140e344/page_28.webp","trel":"R25-11","tstat":"section","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_LinIf_00197 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_LINInterface.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00197"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_LinIf_00198 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_LINInterface.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00198"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_LinIf_00201 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_LINInterface.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00201"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.98,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Explizite Erwähnung von SWS_LinIf_00202 im Text des Dokuments AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_LINInterface.pdf.","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00202"},{"role":"constitutive","co